<title>POLAND: Universal deals Hyundai scooters.</title>
<headline>Universal deals Hyundai scooters.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish trader Universal SA has received exclusive rights to import and distribute Hyundai Hyosung Cab 50 and Super Cab 50 brand motor scooters in Poland, Universal said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>The statement said annual demand for motor scooters in Poland was about 10,000 units and Hyundai planned to gain a dominant market share.</p>
<p>It said the scooters would be sold at 80 dealerships around the country, including some where Hyundai cars are now sold.</p>
<p>Universal has already set up a joint venture with Hyundai to assemble the South Korean firm's Accent cars.</p>
<p>(( -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700 ))</p>
